      "refersTo": "segmented-on",
      "description": "Publication filter; pressed segment inverts.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">First author</button></div>",
      "css": ":host{--m0:#0D0716;--m3:#641A80;--m4:#8C2981;--m5:#B73779;--m6:#DE4968;--m8:#FE9F6D;--m9:#FECF92;--field:#0D0716;--field-ink:#F6EFF4;--field-ink-2:#D8C9DD;--field-muted:#A898B1;--field-rule:rgba(252,253,191,.14);--ground:#FAF9FB;--ink:#1A1024;--ink-2:#44384F;--muted:#675B71;--rule:#E2DDE8;--rule-strong:#C9C0D3;--r:2px;--sans:'Archivo',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;--mono:'Martian Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);font-family:var(--sans);} .ds-seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;} .ds-seg button{font:inherit;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:560;padding:9px 16px;min-height:40px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;} .ds-seg button+button{border-left:1px solid var(--rule-strong);} .ds-seg button:hover{color:var(--ink);} .ds-seg button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ground);} .ds-seg button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--m4);outline-offset:-3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Map Region Label",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "region-name",
      "description": "Cartographic label on the field: dot plus mono ID over tracked caps name.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><a class=\"ds-region\" style=\"--kc:#FE9F6D\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-region__key\">C2</span><span class=\"ds-region__name\">Build the tool</span></a></div>",
      "css": ":host{--m0:#0D0716;--m3:#641A80;--m4:#8C2981;--m5:#B73779;--m6:#DE4968;--m8:#FE9F6D;--m9:#FECF92;--field:#0D0716;--field-ink:#F6EFF4;--field-ink-2:#D8C9DD;--field-muted:#A898B1;--field-rule:rgba(252,253,191,.14);--ground:#FAF9FB;--ink:#1A1024;--ink-2:#44384F;--muted:#675B71;--rule:#E2DDE8;--rule-strong:#C9C0D3;--r:2px;--sans:'Archivo',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;--mono:'Martian Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);font-family:var(--sans);} .ds-field{background:var(--field);padding:40px;} .ds-region{display:inline-grid;justify-items:center;gap:2px;color:var(--field-ink);text-decoration:none;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:var(--r);} .ds-region__key{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4em;font-family:var(--mono);font-stretch:75%;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-shadow:0 1px 10px rgba(13,7,22,.9);} .ds-region__key::before{content:'';width:.62em;height:.62em;border-radius:50%;background:var(--kc);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(13,7,22,.85);} .ds-region__name{font-stretch:125%;font-weight:650;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 1px 10px rgba(13,7,22,.85);} .ds-region:hover,.ds-region:focus-visible{color:#fff;} .ds-region:hover .ds-region__name{text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--kc);text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:.35em;} .ds-region:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--m9);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
